To convert a hipo file to npz format for a given set of banks: after compiling coatjava, cd coatjava, run the script:
 * for all available banks: 	   ./bin/hipoToNpz input.hipo output.npz --schema-dir etc/bankdefs/hipo4
 * for BST::adc,RUN::config banks: ./bin/hipoToNpz input.hipo output.npz --schema-dir etc/bankdefs/hipo4 BST::adc,RUN::config
 * for banks listed in banks.txt:  ./bin/hipoToNpz input.hipo output.npz --schema-dir etc/bankdefs/hipo4 --bank-file banks.txt

To inspect the npz file for n events:
 * python3 list_npz_banks.py /pathTo/MyFile.npz n
Or 
 * python list_npz_banks.py /pathTo/MyFile.npz n

